 "brief": "# Breakroom: agent-swarm-fable-rebuild (Fable)\n\nBrett Nov 3 2026 (voice): go on agent-swarm-fable-rebuild, finish the Breakroom profile.\n\nFirst run: `AXF_BUILD_PROFILE=breakroom node apps/console-web/plugins/build-orchestrator/orchestrator.mjs brief agent-swarm-fable-rebuild` and do every step it lists (7 steps). Read the THREADS.md row and To carry on block for the Fable review of the agent swarm (Brett Nov 1: Opus or Fable only, never Sonnet; Fable reviews first, rebuilds only what it flags). Check origin/main first and skip anything already landed.\n\nTick each: AXF_BUILD_PROFILE=breakroom node apps/console-web/plugins/build-orchestrator/orchestrator.mjs act step agent-swarm-fable-rebuild <sN> done.\n\nRules: one session, no sub-agents; steps <= 30 min. Tokens only (--fx-*), framework controls, no var() fallbacks; check-theme and check-controls pass. Reference engine changed -> regenerate framework/spec/fixtures. Android on hold: Kotlin twins are deferred gaps in PORTING.md. Update the THREADS.md row at each step. Commit + push branch claude/agent-swarm-fable-rebuild often; open the PR at the end (push banner merges it). UI Review shots for any visible change.",
